font_5x8.png is vendored from embedded-graphics v0.8.2:
  https://github.com/embedded-graphics/embedded-graphics/tree/master/fonts/png/iso_8859_1/font_5x8.png

embedded-graphics is dual-licensed MIT / Apache-2.0. This vendored copy
is used solely as build-script input by `secure/build.rs` to extract
glyph bitmaps into a flat constant-time-scannable table — see
`secure/src/ui/secret_text.rs` for the F-24 fix that consumes it.

